+    /// Story 8.8 / AC4 — the loopback router **simulates** cross-Host A2A, so it
+    /// enforces the cross-Host fail-closed posture: an unclassified cross-Host
+    /// frame is denied with `CODE_CONSENT_UNCLASSIFIED` (-32009), never
